- You should stop.

1248
00:44:39,126 --> 00:44:40,796
- You should stop.
- It's better to stop.

1249
00:44:41,026 --> 00:44:44,426
- Okay. One, two, three.
- The game will get...

1250
00:44:44,866 --> 00:44:45,996
Stop.

1251
