We have to get those.

1252
00:44:48,636 --> 00:44:49,796
If we gave them lots of time,

1253
00:44:49,796 --> 00:44:51,066
- they would've gone for it.
- Good choice.

1254
00:44:51,466 --> 00:44:54,406
- Good choice.
- I'm glad you pushed them.

1255
00:44:54,736 --> 00:44:56,606
Actually, we barely made it...

1256
00:44:56,606 --> 00:44:58,106
- through the last round.
- We know.

1257
00:44:58,106 --> 00:44:59,776
- We barely made it.
- Barely.

1258
00:44:59,776 --> 00:45:00,816
Gosh. Good job.

1259
00:45:00,816 --> 00:45:02,416
It's all because we had the chance.

1260
00:45:02,746 --> 00:45:04,446
Anyway, in the end,

1261
