1263
00:45:09,916 --> 00:45:10,986
- Yes.
- Thanks.

1264
00:45:11,426 --> 00:45:12,526
Thank you.

1265
00:45:12,626 --> 00:45:14,296
- Gosh. I'm relieved.
- Gosh. I'm so happy.

1266
00:45:14,296 --> 00:45:17,296
- I'm proud.
- Now I can walk around in peace.

1267
00:45:17,296 --> 00:45:18,766
