- Gosh. Thanks.

1270
00:45:24,036 --> 00:45:27,066
- Thank you.
- We're off to a great start.

1271
00:45:27,266 --> 00:45:29,106
More than anything, we can go on a date,

1272
00:45:29,106 --> 00:45:31,046
