1276
00:45:40,746 --> 00:45:42,086
I loved it.

1277
00:45:42,386 --> 00:45:44,186
I'm excited and so grateful.

1278
00:45:44,886 --> 00:45:47,856
It was an unforgettable day.

1279
00:45:47,856 --> 00:45:49,156
Thank you so much.

1280
00:45:49,156 --> 00:45:50,226
Finally!

1281
00:45:50,226 --> 00:45:51,396
(We hope the sisters had an unforgettable day in Korea.)

1282
00:45:51,766 --> 00:45:53,396
- I'll come back sometime.
- Okay.

1283
00:45:53,396 --> 00:45:54,836
- Goodbye.
- Thanks.

1284
00:45:54,836 --> 00:45:56,366
- Gosh. They even gave us kaymak.
- Bye.

1285
00:45:56,366 --> 00:45:57,836
- Bye. Yes.
- Gosh.

1286
00:45:58,806 --> 00:46:01,436
- I'm so happy after pulling it off.
- It feels so good.

1287
00:46:01,436 --> 00:46:03,536
- We're off to a great start.
- That's right, Jae Seok.

1288
00:46:03,536 --> 00:46:05,076
Gosh. It feels good.

1289
00:46:05,076 --> 00:46:07,576
- Exactly. It does when we succeed.
- That's right.

1290
00:46:07,576 --> 00:46:09,416
Here. We can do it here.

1291
