- Okay.

1296
00:46:18,286 --> 00:46:20,586
- Don't type the address in.
- Because he won't talk.

1297
00:46:20,586 --> 00:46:21,826
You'll just navigate...

1298
00:46:21,826 --> 00:46:23,056
- without talking.
- I got it.

1299
00:46:23,056 --> 00:46:25,226
- I'll do it.
- He's good at the real game.

1300
00:46:25,396 --> 00:46:26,596
He has great focus.

1301
00:46:26,596 --> 00:46:27,936
When we ask him to do something,

1302
00:46:27,936 --> 00:46:29,266
- that's all he does. Yes.
- That's all he does.

1303
00:46:29,366 --> 00:46:30,666
Yes. That's all he does.

1304
00:46:31,166 --> 00:46:32,936
- He's reliable. Yes.
- He's very reliable.

1305
00:46:32,936 --> 00:46:33,936
Yes.

1306
00:46:33,936 --> 00:46:35,836
We got to hear him once while playing the game.

1307
00:46:36,276 --> 00:46:37,336
- "Gosh."
- "Gosh."

1308
00:46:37,336 --> 00:46:38,346
(He forgets to talk when he's in the zone.)

1309
00:46:38,476 --> 00:46:39,706
That's great.

1310
00:46:40,476 --> 00:46:43,946
- Where is it?
- It's a 15-minute walk from here.

1311
00:46:44,886 --> 00:46:46,146
We can walk down...

1312
00:46:46,146 --> 00:46:47,386
- to Shinheung Market.
- Shall we?

1313
00:46:47,386 --> 00:46:48,856
- Yes.
- I can look for places there.

1314
00:46:49,316 --> 00:46:51,956
There's a brunch place. There's a taco spot too.

1315
00:46:51,956 --> 00:46:53,756
- Tacos?
- Tacos sound good.

1316
00:46:53,756 --> 00:46:54,826
Tacos sound great.

1317
00:46:54,826 --> 00:46:58,366
There are some brunch spots.

1318
00:46:58,426 --> 00:47:00,196
Gosh. Tacos sound good.

1319
00:47:00,226 --> 00:47:02,296
- Do tacos sound good?
- They sound great.

1320
00:47:02,466 --> 00:47:03,596
There are bakeries.

1321
00:47:03,596 --> 00:47:05,666
Noodles. There are also places that serve Korean food.

1322
00:47:06,006 --> 00:47:07,136
- Korean food?
- Yes.

1323
00:47:07,136 --> 00:47:08,236
Myeonmaru.

1324
00:47:08,676 --> 00:47:09,836
But he just...

1325
00:47:09,836 --> 00:47:12,846
He said that tacos sound great many times.

1326
