1368
00:48:35,856 --> 00:48:37,196
That's right, Yeon Shik.

1369
00:48:37,196 --> 00:48:39,266
That's why I've kept saying we should go there.

1370
00:48:39,266 --> 00:48:41,536
- Yeon Shik, you didn't want to...
- I love tacos too.

1371
00:48:41,536 --> 00:48:43,466
