- Well, some other places.

1379
00:48:57,216 --> 00:48:59,346
- This is it.
- It's inside this alleyway.

1380
00:48:59,346 --> 00:49:01,186
- That's Shinheung Market.
- It's really famous.

1381
00:49:01,456 --> 00:49:02,816
- The inside here.
- I know.

1382
00:49:02,816 --> 00:49:05,286
They've renovated...

1383
00:49:05,286 --> 00:49:07,056
- the old market.
- I know.

1384
00:49:07,126 --> 00:49:08,226
It's really cool.

1385
00:49:08,526 --> 00:49:10,296
- Gosh.
- It's packed.

1386
00:49:10,296 --> 00:49:11,926
- Now...
- It's completely changed.

1387
00:49:11,926 --> 00:49:13,066
- It's awesome.
- It's totally different.

1388
00:49:13,066 --> 00:49:14,366
It's totally different compared to the last time...

1389
00:49:14,366 --> 00:49:15,636
- I came here.
- Right.

1390
00:49:16,466 --> 00:49:18,336
- There were some old restaurants.
- There used to be.

1391
00:49:18,336 --> 00:49:20,036
- It's totally changed.
- Yes.

1392
00:49:20,206 --> 00:49:21,506
It feels like overseas.

1393
00:49:21,506 --> 00:49:23,736
