1394
00:49:23,736 --> 00:49:25,906
They kept the old buildings.

1395
00:49:26,176 --> 00:49:27,746
They renovated the whole place.

1396
00:49:27,746 --> 00:49:30,176
- It's crazy.
- It's nice and romantic.

1397
00:49:30,176 --> 00:49:31,686
It's been a while since I came here.

1398
00:49:31,686 --> 00:49:34,416
- Right.
- You came before the renovation.

1399
00:49:34,816 --> 00:49:36,086
Gosh. That's right.

1400
00:49:36,086 --> 00:49:37,856
- This is so...
- This is the taco place.

1401
00:49:37,856 --> 00:49:39,626
Why don't we sit in a row right over here?

1402
00:49:39,626 --> 00:49:40,726
Shall we?

1403
00:49:43,056 --> 00:49:44,466
Okay. I'll have tacos...

1404
00:49:44,466 --> 00:49:45,866
- for a change.
- Sounds great.

1405
00:49:45,866 --> 00:49:47,966
I can't believe that guy. I said I wanted tacos.

1406
00:49:48,096 --> 00:49:49,296
My goodness.

1407
00:49:49,496 --> 00:49:51,306
- He kept searching for others.
- I know.

1408
00:49:51,306 --> 00:49:52,406
- So...
- He's like that.

1409
00:49:52,406 --> 00:49:54,836
You said it multiple times, but he pretended he didn't hear you.

1410
00:49:55,776 --> 00:49:58,506
- I could clearly hear him.
- That's right, Dong Hwi.

1411
00:49:58,746 --> 00:50:01,116
- I knew you'd be on my side.
- Of course.

1412
00:50:01,316 --> 00:50:03,376
Also, he was the one who mentioned tacos first.

1413
00:50:03,516 --> 00:50:05,546
- He mentioned them first.
- Exactly.

1414
