00:50:11,426 --> 00:50:13,826
Hold on. We have to place the order with the QR code.

1418
00:50:14,186 --> 00:50:15,196
- What are you having?
- What is it?

1419
00:50:15,196 --> 00:50:16,996
I'll get beef bulgogi tacos.

1420
00:50:16,996 --> 00:50:19,166
- I'll get them too.
